<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 4</h3>Normal mode tier tokens are no longer acquirable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> due to the introduction of LFR items on Dragon Soul, thus Valor can be more freely spent on best in slot pieces such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77096/woundlicker-cover">
<img alt="Woundlicker Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woundlicker Cover</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77083/lightning-spirit-in-a-bottle">
<img alt="Lightning Spirit in a Bottle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_feather_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Spirit in a Bottle</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77114/bottled-wishes">
<img alt="Bottled Wishes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bottled Wishes</span></a> is also an important item for early Spine of Deathwing progress, as it will give you high burst damage that lines up with exposed tendon phases, so make sure to buy it if you will be getting there early!<br/>
<br/>Finally, while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77108/seal-of-the-grand-architect">
<img alt="Seal of the Grand Architect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Grand Architect</span></a> is a better item than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77109/band-of-reconstruction">
<img alt="Band of Reconstruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Reconstruction</span></a> in a vacuum, you might want to pick up the Spirit option if you ever plan on going Restoration, and a similar idea applies to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77089/threadlinked-chain">
<img alt="Threadlinked Chain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Threadlinked Chain</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77088/opal-of-the-secret-order">
<img alt="Opal of the Secret Order" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Opal of the Secret Order</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
